/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ *
 * Cosite interference analysis -- SLC output tables + %fiveobs macro.
 *
 * The upstream program builds four frequency-sweep tables in a Python/R
 * pipeline and lands them under a Windows sas7bdat library (libname lgs
 * sas7bdat "d:/lgs";), then prints the first five observations of each
 * with the %fiveobs macro.  Here the four tables are loaded from the
 * frequency-sweep values shipped alongside the program (the *_data.csv
 * companions), so the %fiveobs macro runs exactly as written against the
 * same isolation / reflection / total_coupling / transmission data.
 * ------------------------------------------------------------------ */

